    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Newcombe Estates are delighted to bring to the market this superb two bedroom duplex ideally located in the heart of Ongar Village. 39 North Street offers bright, well proportioned accommodation extending over two levels, designed with modern living in mind. \r\nThe property benefits from gas fired central heating and double-glazed windows, ensuring excellent energy efficiency and year-round comfort. The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious and light filled living area with south west facing balcony, and a contemporary kitchen/dining  ideal for everyday living. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms(one en- suite) and a well appointed main bathroom. \r\nNorth Street is a highly sought after area within walking distance of Ongar Village, with its excellent selection of shops, cafés, schools, and local amenities. The area is superbly serviced by public transport links and offers easy access to the N3/M50, and Blanchardstown Centre.\r\nThis property will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors alike seeking a stylish, energy efficient home in a prime Dublin 15 location.\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\t\t\t\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\twith laminate wood floor and alarm control panel \r\n\r\nLounge:\tfeature fireplace with slate surround and wooden mantle, laminate wood floor, TV point and door to south facing balcony\r\n3.7x5.5   \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: modern fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, fitted, shelving, tiled splash-back, tiled floor, oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher \r\n3.3x2.5m\t\t\r\n\t\t       \r\n1st Floor \r\n\r\nLanding:\twith carpeted flooring and access to attic \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with laminate wood floor and TV point \r\n3.8x3.0m\r\n\r\nEnsuite: with shower, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with laminate wood floor and TV point\r\n3.8x2.7m\t \r\n\r\nBathroom: with bath, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\n\r\nCommunal car-parking to front \r\nLarge rear balcony with south west aspect overlooking landscaped green area \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nDouble glazed windows and door \r\nAnnual Service Charge c. €1218"
      },
